Adatum Corporation must enable bulk execution on the Azure Cosmos DB .NET SDK client so many concurrent writes are grouped into per-partition batches. Complete the client options. Which property fills the blank?

```
CosmosClientOptions options = new CosmosClientOptions
{
    ________ = true
};
CosmosClient client = new CosmosClient(endpoint, credential, options);
```

VanArsdel applies optimistic concurrency to a ReplaceItemAsync call in the Azure Cosmos DB .NET SDK so the write only succeeds if the item is unchanged. Complete the request options. Which property fills the blank?

```
ItemRequestOptions options = new ItemRequestOptions
{
    ________ = item.ETag
};
await container.ReplaceItemAsync(item, item.Id,
    new PartitionKey(item.Pk), options);
```

Contoso Suites sets a 30-minute integrated cache staleness on an Azure Cosmos DB for NoSQL query in the .NET SDK. Complete the dedicated gateway request options. Which property fills the blank?

```
QueryRequestOptions options = new QueryRequestOptions
{
    DedicatedGatewayRequestOptions = new DedicatedGatewayRequestOptions
    {
        ________ = TimeSpan.FromMinutes(30)
    }
};
```

Complete the statement so the current IVFFlat session searches 20 lists. Which setting fills the blank?

```
SET ________ = 20;
SELECT id FROM items ORDER BY embedding <=> $1 LIMIT 5;
```
